{"id":215,"name":"sneasel","speciesId":215,"dex":215,"form":"normal","generation":2,"types":["dark","ice"],"stats":{"hp":55,"attack":95,"defense":55,"special-attack":35,"special-defense":75,"speed":115},"abilities":[{"name":"inner-focus","hidden":false},{"name":"keen-eye","hidden":false},{"name":"pickpocket","hidden":true}],"height":9,"weight":280,"baseExp":86,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/215.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/215.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/215.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/215.ogg","genus":"Sharp Claw Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Garra Afiada","flavor":[{"version":"gold","text":"Its paws conceal sharp claws. If attacked, it sud­ denly extends the claws and startles its enemy."},{"version":"silver","text":"Vicious in nature, it drives PIDGEY from their nests and feasts on the eggs that are left behind."},{"version":"crystal","text":"This cunning POKéMON hides under the cover of darkness, waiting to attack its prey."},{"version":"ruby","text":"SNEASEL scales trees by punching its hooked claws into the bark. This POKéMON seeks out unguarded nests and steals eggs for food while the parents are away."},{"version":"emerald","text":"A SNEASEL scales trees by punching its hooked claws into the bark. It seeks out unguarded nests and steals eggs for food while the parents are away."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Its paws conceal sharp claws. If attacked, it suddenly extends the claws and startles its enemy."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It feeds on eggs stolen from nests. Its sharply hooked claws rip vulnerable spots on prey."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It is extremely vicious and will not stop attacking until its foe is incapable of moving."},{"version":"platinum","text":"A 